                <pb facs="0147" n="141" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg141"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received January 11.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Russian minister for foreign affairs asks whether the United States is inclined
                    to entertain proposals for modus regarding North Pacific seal fisheries like
                    that now existing between Russia and Great Britain. If so, Russian Government
                    will present such proposal. Dispatch follows.</p>
            </div>
